    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Alpa</strong></i> is a third- and first-person narrative adventure that blends atmospheric exploration, puzzle-solving, and a deeply emotional story experienced through the eyes of three intertwined souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dreamlike worlds, mystical forests, and ethereal landscapes as you uncover fragments of the past and face emotional and symbolic challenges. Each environment is crafted as a living character, holding secrets waiting to be revealed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and emotional narrative exploring themes of loss, redemption, and spiritual connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, each with their own perspective and unique narrative arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental and symbolic puzzles organically woven into the story and surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard, mouse, and gamepad controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Alpa</i></strong> is more than a game<strong> \u2014 it's a sensorial journey that invites you to reflect and feel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re drawn to games with soul, this adventure was made for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.poster.avif?t=1746728537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.webm?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.mp4?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/918dbc5d86e9afe87b006c144f226bc6.avif?t=1746728537\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/d057ea17ad23e2ff3d2928a244bed2fb.avif?t=1746728537\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.poster.avif?t=1746728537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.webm?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.mp4?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Alpa</strong></i> is a third- and first-person narrative adventure that blends atmospheric exploration, puzzle-solving, and a deeply emotional story experienced through the eyes of three intertwined souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dreamlike worlds, mystical forests, and ethereal landscapes as you uncover fragments of the past and face emotional and symbolic challenges. Each environment is crafted as a living character, holding secrets waiting to be revealed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and emotional narrative exploring themes of loss, redemption, and spiritual connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters, each with their own perspective and unique narrative arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental and symbolic puzzles organically woven into the story and surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for keyboard, mouse, and gamepad controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Alpa</i></strong> is more than a game<strong> \u2014 it's a sensorial journey that invites you to reflect and feel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re drawn to games with soul, this adventure was made for you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.poster.avif?t=1746728537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.webm?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/a08e9a4a99ba5bac4391d85b8c227b42.mp4?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/918dbc5d86e9afe87b006c144f226bc6.avif?t=1746728537\" data-has-big width=800 height=410 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/d057ea17ad23e2ff3d2928a244bed2fb.avif?t=1746728537\" data-has-big width=800 height=412 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.poster.avif?t=1746728537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.webm?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706580/extras/c7032e2b5ba55eb6ac5d3efa8dda6003.mp4?t=1746728537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
